Description: Querencia Desktop text editor (alpha)
 Querencia Editor is the text editor of Querencia Desktop, a classic
 desktop in the style of GNOME 2, modelled on gedit 2.30: tabs, syntax
 highlighting (GtkSourceView 5), search and replace, line numbers.
 The interface is English with a German translation (gettext).
 .
 Querencia Desktop is developed with AI tools; every change is reviewed
 and accepted by the project owner.
 This is an alpha release.
